WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Not only is the U.N. not solving the problems it should,

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.720
too often it's actually creating new problems for us to solve.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.880
The best example is the number one political issue

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.560
of our time, the crisis of uncontrolled migration.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.440
It's uncontrolled.

